# Plan Lifecycle

When a plan's status is changed to "Complete":

1. Move the file from `active/` to `completed/` (preserving subdirectory structure)
2. Update any references in `00-master-plan.md` if needed

Example:
```bash
mv .cursor/plans/active/monorepo-migration/02-packages-outline.md \
   .cursor/plans/completed/monorepo-migration/
```
